--TEST--
An `[ext.<name>]` key the extension's manifest does not declare stops the boot, naming the entry — ADR 0246 § 9
--EXTENSION--
ledger
--FILE nvs.toml--
[ext.ledger]
colour = "red"
--FILE--
<?nvs
// `Shop\Ledger` declares only the setting `currency`.
// The block above sets `colour`, so this program never runs.
echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0652]: The extension `%sledger.nvsx` does not load: `[ext.ledger]` has an unknown key `colour`: the extension declares `currency`
%A
